[13057]="70044D66\n1\tSeek out the baths in the Southern Great Guest-house\tThe Southern Great Guest-house is near the Citadel. You should seek out the baths in the Southern Great Guest-house.\n2\tSpeak with Iorlas\tIorlas can be found at the Southern Great Guest-house near the Citadel. You should speak to Iorlas.\n3\tCollect dirty drying cloths (total: 8)\tThe Southern Great Guest-house is near the Citadel. You should collect dirty cloths from the baths.\n4\tWash the cloths in a bucket (total: 4)\tThe Southern Great Guest-house is near the Citadel. You should clean the cloths in a bucket.\n5\tRinse the cloths in a water bucket (total: 2)\tThe Southern Great Guest-house is near the Citadel. You should rinse the cloths in a water bucket.\n6\tSpeak with Iorlas\tIorlas can be found at the Southern Great Guest-house near the Citadel. You should speak to Iorlas.\n",
[13058]="7006D545\n1\tTalk to Ningêna\tYou should travel to the Wrackwade and talk to Ningêna.\n",
[13059]="700431DD\n1\tTalk to Angbor near the Crossings of Erui\tLord Angbor can likely be found somewhere near the Crossings of Erui in eastern Upper Lebennin. Lady Terenis has asked you to speak to Lord Angbor about the Haradrim forces near the Erui.\n2\tTravel south to Halach\tHalach can be found in south-eastern Upper Lebennin along the Anduin. Angbor has asked you to secure the southern settlements of Upper Lebennin and uncover the plans of the Haradrim before rejoining him in Lossarnach.\n3\tSearch the ruins of Halach for any survivors\tSurvivors may be found somewhere within Halach in south-eastern Upper Lebennin. You have arrived at the ruined settlement of Halach, and should now search for survivors.\n",
[13060]="7003077D\n1\tBusca supervivientes en las granjas saqueadas\tLas granjas saqueadas se encuentran lejos hacia el suroeste de Campo de Lanzas.\n2\tBusca supervivientes en las granjas saqueadas\tLas granjas saqueadas se encuentran lejos hacia el suroeste de Campo de Lanzas.\n3\tHabla con Sigeric\tHas avistado a un granjero capturado entre los Orcos que han saqueado esta granja. Es curioso que haya sido dejado con vida hasta ahora, pero es probable que eso cambie una vez que los Orcos terminen de saquear los recursos de la zona.\n4\tHabla con Gísil\tGísil se encuentra dentro del Salón del Hidromiel de Garsfeld.\n",
[13061]="700715FF\n1\tInvestigate the area outside the Blade-horn for clues\tKhaljûn has requested your aid in investigating disturbing sounds coming from the Blade-horn, an ancient and mysterious structure north of Sormedân. Khaljûn fears something evil has taken hold there.\n2\tInvestigate the area around the disturbed spirit\tInvestigate the area around the disturbed spirit.\n3\tPick up the dusty book in the dirt\tInvestigate the area for more information about the mysterious spirit.\n4\tReturn to Khaljûn in Sormedân and show him the journal\tReturn to Khaljûn in Sormedân and show him the journal you've found.\n",
[13062]="70071D7C\n1\tMeet with Khaljûn outside the Blade-horn\tMeet with Khaljûn outside the Blade-horn. The Blade-horn can be found south-east of Sormedân.\n2\tEnter the interior of the Blade-horn\tEnter the interior of the Blade-horn.\n3\tDefeat the Tasked Ones within the Blade-horn (total: 10)\030Search for books about the Tarsâri inside the Blade-horn (total: 6)\tDefeat the Tasked Ones and search for books mentioning the Tarsâri within the Blade-horn.\n4\tSpeak with Khaljûn outside the Blade-horn\tSpeak with Khaljûn outside the Blade-horn.\n",
[13063]="70071CF0\n1\tSpeak with Khaljûn outside the Blade-horn when you are ready to go\tSpeak with Khaljûn outside the Blade-horn when you are ready to go.\n2\tSpeak with Khaljûn outside the Blade-horn\tSpeak with Khaljûn outside the Blade-horn.\n",
[13064]="70071D88\n1\tSpeak with Khaljûn outside the Blade-horn when you are ready to go\tSpeak with Khaljûn outside the Blade-horn when you are ready to go.\n2\tSpeak with Khaljûn outside the Blade-horn\tSpeak with Khaljûn outside the Blade-horn.\n",
[13065]="70071D83\n1\tJoin Khaljûn at Khamósh-engar\tJoin Khaljûn at Khamósh-engar. Khamósh-engar can be found just outside of Sormedân on the hill.\n2\tSpeak with Khaljûn at Khamósh-engar\tSpeak with Khaljûn at Khamósh-engar.\n3\tGather memorial stones for Khaljûn (total: 7)\tGather stones for Khaljûn suitable to making a stele in remembrance of his brother.\n4\tSpeak with Khaljûn at Khamósh-engar\tSpeak with Khaljûn at Khamósh-engar.\n5\tGive Khaljûn space for his thoughts at Khamósh-engar\tGive Khaljûn space for his thoughts at Khamósh-engar.\n6\tHelp Khaljûn craft the finished stone to honour Mashâr\tHelp Khaljûn craft the finished stone to honour Mashâr.\n7\tBow to pay your respects to Mashâr\tBow to pay your respects to Mashâr.\n8\tSpeak with Khaljûn at Khamósh-engar\tSpeak with Khaljûn at Khamósh-engar.\n",
[13066]="70041380\n1\tHabla con Clothar Hojarena y te mostrará dónde vio al gran oso\tClothar Hojarena se encuentra en el Campamento de Adso y quiere que investigues al gran oso que lo aterrorizó.\n2\tHabla con Clothar Hojarena en el Campamento de Adso\tClothar Hojarena se encuentra en el Campamento de Adso. Lo ayudaste a rastrear al gran oso que lo había aterrorizado y también ayudaste al oso a encontrar consuelo. Clothar ahora sabe que perteneces a la estirpe de Beorn y le está costando adaptarse a ese conocimiento.\n",
[13067]="700683CA\n1\tCollect sacks of spice ([según el diario]/12)\tSeek spice from the sand-storms and sand-worms in the desert north of the expedition camp. Collect twelve sacks of desert spice and return them to Khânai.\n2\tHaving recovered the spice that Khânai requested, it is time to return the sacks of freshly gathered herbs to her at the Hunter's encampment.\t\n",
[13068]="70054680\n1\tDefeat spiders in Torech Ungol (total: 15)\tThe spider-horde has completely overrun Torech Ungol. You should defeat spiders in Torech Ungol.\n2\tHabla con Legolas.\tLegolas is standing by outside Torech Ungol. You should talk to Legolas.\n",
[13069]="70015791\n1\tLleva un diamante imbuido a Fastarr\tFastarr te ha pedido que le traigas un diamante imbuido que él pueda preparar para otorgar una calidad a tu arma. Desafortunadamente, no sabe dónde se puede encontrar una piedra así.\n2\tHabla con Fastarr para viajar al nido de arañas\tA Fastarr se le puede encontrar en el Campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, en Moria. Fastarr te ha pedido que viajes a la armería de sus antepasados y rescates a sus parientes, atrapados en su interior por las voraces arañas que los han capturado.\n3\tLleva el diamante potenciado a Fastarr\tA Fastarr se le puede encontrar en el Campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, en Moria. Deberías regresar con Fastarr para completar la mejora de tu arma.\n",
[13070]="7004DB87\n1\tCompleta 'Una primavera ajetreada (introducción)'\tTodos los días hay algo que hacer durante el Festival de Primavera. ¡Únete a todo el mundo y participa en las diversas actividades del Festival de Primavera durante cuatro días!\n2\tCompleta 'Una primavera ajetreada (intermedio)'\tTodos los días hay algo que hacer durante el Festival de Primavera. ¡Únete a todo el mundo y participa en las diversas actividades del Festival de Primavera durante cuatro días más!\n3\tCompleta 'Una primavera ajetreada (final)'\tTodos los días hay algo que hacer durante el Festival de Primavera. ¡Únete a todo el mundo y participa en las muchas actividades del Festival de Primavera durante cuatro días más!\n4\tHabla con el sargento Tom\030Talk to TBD\tYou have participated in Spring Festival activities for twelve days! You should talk to either Sergeant Tom at the Bree-land Festival Grounds or TBD near the Stable-master in Clegur.\n",
[13071]="70065B1B\n1\tThama Aklam is host to many suspicious coffers. Inspect coffers in Thama Aklam.\t\n2\tThama Aklam has become home to a number of brigands.\t\n3\tYou have inspected many coffers.\t\n",
[13072]="70048F6D\n1\tClaim your reward!\tYou have received a reward for successfully preparing the Host of the West for its conflict at the Black Gate against the forces of Mordor.\n2\tCompletado\tYou have received a reward for successfully preparing the Host of the West for its conflict at the Black Gate against the forces of Mordor.\n",
[13073]="70015E0C\n1\tDerrota a Pizumu, maestro de espías\tPizumu, el maestro espía, se encuentra al noreste de Echad Dúnann, por la carretera que serpentea hacia la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo. Authlanc te ha pedido que elimines al maestro espía de Saruman.\n2\tHabla con Authlanc en Echad Dúnann\tAuthlanc está en Echad Dúnann, al suroeste de la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo. Debes regresar a Authlanc e informarle de tu éxito.\n",
